+---
+id: pthm-aqft-global-anomaly-test
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: A global SU(2) determinant-line phase and its mod-two inflow cancellation
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
