+## Completed item: `def-aqft-global-anomaly-holonomy`
+
+**Claim and conventions.** Defines the inverse determinant-line holonomy for a smooth Fredholm family of chiral Dirac operators on compact closed even-dimensional Riemannian spin manifolds, with a fixed unitary representation, Quillen metric, Bismut–Freed connection, endpoint gauge identification, and fixed regularization/counterterm convention. The phase is in $U(1)$. Its planned direct supplier is `def-aqft-thooft-anomaly`, currently absent as above, so this item remains conditional.
