+
+**Proof status and next action.** The two proof steps establish scalar evaluation from dual lines and the holonomy cancellation criterion. This item remains conditional on the missing `def-aqft-thooft-anomaly` carrier. The A theorem and B example are now authored; the next action is to synchronize the manifest/contracts/coverage, record source fetch stamps and escalated readiness, and run the scoped checks.
