+
+**Sources read.** Wang, Wen, and Witten, *A New SU(2) Anomaly*, §2.2, PDF pp. 6–9, equations (2.3)–(2.8): the one-instanton index parity, fermion zero-mode measure sign, and periodic-spin mapping-torus mod-two index. Dai–Freed, §5, PDF pp. 31–35, Corollary 5.11 and proof of the holonomy formula. Freed, Lecture 11 §§11.1–11.2, PDF pp. 154–163, for determinant/Pfaffian lines and relative theory structure. Source bodies have been inspected; fetch stamps remain pending.
+
+**Proof status and next action.** The argument proves the determinant-line sign from the explicit index input, checks its tensor powers and mod-two bulk cancellation, and performs the finite $BC_2$ sum. Readiness remains escalated because `def-aqft-thooft-anomaly` is absent and the root index theorem is not an active physics import. The local/published status of those mathematical results is not inferred from labels alone.
