+## Completed item: `ex-aqft-anomaly-inflow-example`
+
+**Claim and conventions.** Reuses the same $S^4$ index-one model and $C_2$ center action, then computes the inverse line character and one-object finite groupoid normalization. It also checks two copies; this verifies only the stated transformation and not absence of other anomalies.
+
+**Dependencies.** `pthm-aqft-global-anomaly-test`, `def-aqft-global-anomaly-holonomy`, `def-aqft-anomaly-inflow-relative-theory`, and `def-qftx-finite-groupoid-integration`. Planned `dependency_level: 4`, one above the theorem's level 3.
+
