+
+## Definition references
+
+[Dai and Freed, §§1–2 and §5](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/9405012)
+
+[Freed, Lecture 11, §§11.1–11.2](https://abel.math.harvard.edu/~dafr/CBMS133.pdf)
+
+## Facts & Assumptions
+
+**Given:** The compact spin manifold, bundle, connection, unitary representation, smooth Fredholm family, and regularized Hermitian line with unitary connection in the Definition.
+
+[F1] [[def-aqft-thooft-anomaly]] is planned to define the residual background-gauge variation modulo a specified local-counterterm space, with dynamical-gauge inconsistency and explicit symmetry breaking separated. Its batch-41 carrier is currently absent, so that interface use remains conditional.
