+---
+id: def-aqft-anomaly-inflow-relative-theory
+kind: definition
+title: Relative boundary theory and invertible anomaly inflow
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
+dependency_level: 5
